WEBVTT

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:30.620
As reported earlier, regarding the explosion in
the old urban area, the police now say that...

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:35.620
since they haven't detected any link
to flammable material such as gas...

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:40.630
they are concerned that it may have been a
bombing conducted by terrorist extremists.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:45.630
This is just in. Awide-scale traffic accident has
occured from Alexander to Pyramid Streets...

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:50.870
and due to this incident, the traffic system
is jammed in the center of the downtown...

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:56.040
Run...!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.810
Jo...ta...ro...

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:01.280
Keep...a distance...

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.390
Hey, hey...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.760
is that all, Jotaro?

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.830
Is that all the power you've got?

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:22.470
Bastard...

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.670
A jabbing speed competition...

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.810
Not even close.

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.290
So lame, so lame!

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:44.250
The World!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:51.930
Time has frozen.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.000
This guy...

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.230
with only this level of Stand power...

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:03.470
I don't understand why he
was able to survive my attack.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.440
Mysterious...

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:18.610
The grand finale was unexpectedly simple.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:25.150
The Joestar bloodline
that pestered me, Dio...

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:27.700
is finally coming to an end.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.340
What the...!?

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.300
I've taken damage...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.850
but I'm alright.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.110
Why...!?

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:42.850
I survived again!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:44.950
Jotaro...

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.480
what did you do just now?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:53.250
I'm asking you what you did!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.260
Why are you still alive!?

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.590
You got me...

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.720
for all I know, your Stand
isn't all you crack it up to be.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.160
Hold your tongue!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.170
The World!

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.070
This...

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.010
This is...

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:13.980
It can't be!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.450
Star Platinum!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:24.120
Y...Y...

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.250
Y-you!?

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:44.370
Without any conscious effort...

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.310
Star Platinum has been protecting me.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:52.020
Briefly, I thought I saw him...

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:54.550
moving inside the 'frozen time.'

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.680
Moving...!?

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.630
Incredible.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.110
Jotaro...

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.180
His Star Platinum and 'The World'...

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.470
are similar types of Stands.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:29.620
Unexpected.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:34.060
It was unexpected for him to
come inside my 'frozen time.'

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.350
You followed me with your eyes...

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.230
within the 'frozen time.'

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.630
Not unlike a child learning
how to ride a bicycle...

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.330
who would be riding around in no time...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.370
once he gets the hang of it.

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.340
Kakyoin...

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.600
revealed the secret of 'The World...'

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.200
so you have acknowledged
the idea of 'time freeze...'

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:57.910
...and became aware of
'moving inside frozen time.'

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:01.610
I suppose the deaths of your
comrades were not wasted after all.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:03.220
You...!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.720
Kakyoin!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:05.950
So now...

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.050
I, Dio, am thinking...

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:13.190
about how many seconds can you
move inside the frozen time, and such?

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.470
A second or two...?

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.090
Or maybe, like me...

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.830
you can move around
for five seconds or so...

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.640
but are pretending you can't, and such.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.840
This is bad...

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:28.670
he's able to move for five seconds...

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:32.640
Earlier, my frantic efforts enabled
me to move for an instant...

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.480
I can't let Dio know about this...

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.290
that's not enough time...
for me to fight back!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.920
I'm sure you don't want me to know.

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.220
From what I can see...

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.590
you are limited to moving
only for an instant, at best.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:50.070
But you're able to move inside the
frozen time, no matter how briefly...

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:52.270
and to approach you without caution...

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:54.470
is not something a wise person would do.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.700
The attack you made
earlier was quite powerful.

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.330
It was very stimulating.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.280
So then, Jotaro...

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.280
Regardless of how many
seconds you can move...

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:09.910
I just thought of a way to execute you!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.390
You're growing pale.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.630
Have you realized that your end will
be more terrible than Joseph's?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:19.560
Useless!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.560
This is checkmate!

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.190
The World!

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:37.350
How are you going to get away
from these knives, Jotaro!?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:45.410
The fact that you can still see makes
it even more frightening, doesn't it?

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.400
If you don't do something about it
now, you'll have problems later...!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.080
Is that all you can move?

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:14.240
Now that it has been proven that
you can only move for an instant...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.720
Time is up.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.430
It's all over.

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:33.900
Just one more, to make certain!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:48.690
To tell you the truth, I'm relieved
that I could kill you early on, Jotaro.

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:53.230
I never thought you could enter
my world of 'frozen time...'

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:21.380
what a pain.

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.720
How dare he put holes through
my prized school jacket.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.730
I managed to survive,
thanks to the splints...

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.260
for the broken ribs he gave me
when we were at his mansion.

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:34.630
But, the damage is pretty heavy.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:39.470
I guess I have no choice but to
play dead and wait for my chance.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:44.240
If he throws knives at me again, I don't
think I can dodge them completely.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.580
I've got to find a way to deliver
a direct blow to his head.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:12:59.860
Is he dead?

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:01.160
No...

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.520
I can't be too cautious when
dealing with the Joestar bloodline.

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:04.530
This is the first time...

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.000
for me, Dio, to feel a tinge of fear.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.430
I shouldn't go near him carelessly.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.160
He might be playing dead.

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:16.630
How about his breathing?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.280
I can't hear anything.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.380
He's not breathing.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.810
How about...

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.290
his heartbeat.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.210
This sucks...!

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:58.410
Damn...

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.620
if I pass out now...

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:02.810
seriously...

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.850
I-I'm a goner!

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:09.250
Some kinda bad joke...

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:13.020
to use my own Stand to stop my heart...

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:13.900
and d....

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:15.730
and d-die from it.

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:16.700
and d...

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.700
and d-die from it...!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.790
His heart is not beating.

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.360
He is indeed dead.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.700
Let's see...

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.400
just in case, I should sever his neck...

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.380
to ensure peace of mind.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:00.800
Right, Jotaro...?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.550
This is the end.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.630
Go to hell!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.760
Dio!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:28.670
Polnareff!?

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.400
Have you failed, Iced!?

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:35.410
What the...!?

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.480
At last...

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.860
At last, I managed to deliver
a direct blow to his head.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.000
I made it in time.

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.830
Did you finish off Dio...?

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:57.730
Polnareff...

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.330
H-hey, your injuries...!

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:03.130
Don't mind me. Get him!

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.300
Avenge Avdol and Iggi!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.040
Iggi...!?

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.040
Bastard...

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.090
No good...

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:21.050
I can't move anymore.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.220
Don't talk, Polnareff!

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.460
This is pathetic.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:31.660
Just wait here.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.440
Right now...

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.130
I'm going to take care of some business!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:36.380
I'll...

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.310
I'll kill you...!

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:45.880
What's going on?

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.020
My legs are w-weak!

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:50.420
I have a headache...

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:51.720
n-nausea too!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:53.820
H-How could this be!?

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.190
For I, Dio...

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.890
to feel sick?

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.020
I, Dio...

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.330
That...

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:01.660
Jotaro...

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.000
destroyed my head...

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:05.870
so I couldn't stand!?

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:13.640
Dio...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.110
I won't forgive you.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.580
Resign to your fate...

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.870
The World!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:48.940
Time...

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.040
is in motion.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.280
To that place...

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:57.910
If I can make it to that place...

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:07.160
To that place!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.930
I-if I can only make it to that place...

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:21.640
Enough of this game of tag.

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:24.720
Just give up now, Dio.

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.490
Time freezes, The Wor...!

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.440
I got you, Jotaro!

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.270
This is my 'escape route!'

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.070
You lost against me,
Dio, in this game of wits!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:54.150
Doesn't this street look familiar?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.710
Being a tourist...

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.840
do all the streets look the same to you!?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.480
Th...

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:01.980
This street...

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:03.780
Can it be!?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:14.120
That's right!

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.860
For me to suck the blood
of Joseph Joestar...

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.790
this is the escape route!

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:21.530
Y...

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:23.260
You...!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.700
It's fitting.

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.400
It's fitting well!

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:28.630
Yes, indeed!

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:35.880
This body is that of my enemy from
hundred years ago, Jonathan Joestar.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.310
What I sucked just now is the
blood of his grandson, Joseph!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:45.280
And the person who allowed me to
escape to this place, Jotaro...was you!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.260
The Joestar's bloodline...

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:51.300
was a nuisance, like a dog turd
in the road to my destiny, but...

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:56.260
in the very end, you were all
meant to be used by me, Dio.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:58.800
Y...

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.730
You'll never get away with this!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.910
What nonsense.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:04.670
Look!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.780
He's been squeezed...bone-dry.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.180
No one can stay unaffected
after seeing something like this!

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:22.420
Dio!

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.120
You've made me...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.790
incredibly angry!

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:30.630
This is the final round.

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:31.530
Let's go!

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:35.100
The World!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:36.340
Time is frozen!

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.160
Quite impressive, Jotaro.

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:04.240
You're actually prolonging the
time you can move around.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:09.670
But I'm feeling more powerful...

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:14.650
I, Dio can stop the time longer!

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:18.180
Thanks to Joestar's blood!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.680
As they say, I'm getting 'high!'

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.660
Stand power...I'm bursting with it!

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.440
Sink, will ya!

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:54.980
Not yet...

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.120
not nearly enough...

00:21:57.220 --> 00:21:59.320
I'm not angry enough yet!

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.830
DIO!

00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:42.230
Don't!

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:43.060
Get away from...!

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:45.030
You're in my way, you lowly beings!

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:29.470
It feels great...

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:30.810
this surge of power!

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:50.460
What!?

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:55.870
Useless trick!

00:24:09.520 --> 00:24:11.510
We've had enough warming up...

00:24:11.620 --> 00:24:12.180
Jotaro!

00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:15.220
This truly is the final
instance that I stop time!

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.550
The World!

00:24:27.310 --> 00:24:29.900
That bastard not showing
himself bothers me, but...

00:24:30.010 --> 00:24:31.270
it doesn't matter.

00:24:31.640 --> 00:24:33.980
I've decided on what I'm going to do...

00:24:34.350 --> 00:24:35.940
as long as I can move...

00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:38.520
I will blast Star Platinum against him.

00:24:41.490 --> 00:24:43.850
There's something I'm very sure of, Dio...!

00:24:45.220 --> 00:24:47.750
The next moment I see your face...

00:24:47.860 --> 00:24:49.160
I will probably...

00:24:49.260 --> 00:24:51.990
go totally berserk!

00:24:52.870 --> 00:24:53.730
Come on!

00:24:54.530 --> 00:24:55.360
Dio!

00:25:02.980 --> 00:25:04.340
An oil tanker!

00:25:21.090 --> 00:25:22.860
I'll crush you to death!

00:25:38.180 --> 00:25:39.300
It's over.

00:25:40.310 --> 00:25:43.580
At last, I've stamped out Joestar's bloodline.

00:25:45.120 --> 00:25:49.420
Now, it is proven that no
one can surpass me, Dio!

00:25:50.620 --> 00:25:52.610
You insignificant human beings!

00:25:52.760 --> 00:25:54.280
I shall rule over you!

00:25:54.790 --> 00:25:57.850
You will grovel at my heels...
to my wisdom and power!

00:26:17.450 --> 00:26:17.940
W...

00:26:18.450 --> 00:26:19.110
What the... !?

00:26:21.850 --> 00:26:22.840
I-I can't...

00:26:23.420 --> 00:26:24.150
move!

00:26:25.760 --> 00:26:26.620
I-it can't be!?

00:26:26.760 --> 00:26:28.660
My body isn't moving at all!?

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:33.120
The time you can move seems to be over.

00:26:33.530 --> 00:26:34.020
Wha...!

00:26:34.900 --> 00:26:35.960
What!?

00:26:44.380 --> 00:26:46.310
I froze time!

00:26:48.210 --> 00:26:50.010
Jotaro...!

00:26:52.890 --> 00:26:54.380
How does it feel?

00:26:56.220 --> 00:26:59.450
What's it like when you
want to move, but can't?

00:27:05.530 --> 00:27:06.330
Time...

00:27:06.430 --> 00:27:07.460
is in motion!

00:27:12.100 --> 00:27:14.870
I have no mercy for you.

00:27:16.040 --> 00:27:19.010
I don't feel sorry for you at all.

00:27:20.310 --> 00:27:23.340
But torturing you to the end...

00:27:23.450 --> 00:27:26.680
would leave a bad taste in my mouth!

00:27:27.150 --> 00:27:30.090
How many seconds does
it take for that leg to heal?

00:27:30.220 --> 00:27:33.780
I will blast you with my Star
Platinum the moment you recover!

00:27:33.930 --> 00:27:34.920
Bring it on!

00:27:36.500 --> 00:27:38.290
How dare you insult me.

00:27:38.430 --> 00:27:39.950
But, Jotaro...

00:27:40.330 --> 00:27:44.100
even in this crucial moment,
you are human after all.

00:27:44.240 --> 00:27:48.430
Your way of thinking is meant
to live a short period of time.

00:27:50.140 --> 00:27:51.940
Leave a bad taste in your mouth, you say?

00:27:52.750 --> 00:27:54.610
A rat turd in a pit...

00:27:54.710 --> 00:27:58.110
that's all such nonsense is...
a fatal mistake of yours.

00:27:58.880 --> 00:28:00.880
For me, Dio, that's not the case.

00:28:02.190 --> 00:28:04.250
There is...only one...

00:28:04.360 --> 00:28:05.880
simple ideal...

00:28:07.430 --> 00:28:09.490
victory and conquest!

00:28:09.600 --> 00:28:10.690
That's all.

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:13.460
The process...

00:28:15.100 --> 00:28:16.690
and method...

00:28:17.600 --> 00:28:19.430
really doesn't matter!

00:28:20.810 --> 00:28:21.670
Got you!

00:28:22.040 --> 00:28:22.600
Die!

00:28:41.930 --> 00:28:43.660
...What...!?

00:28:48.330 --> 00:28:49.130
It can't be!

00:28:49.230 --> 00:28:49.890
I...

00:28:50.040 --> 00:28:50.760
Dio...

00:28:51.200 --> 00:28:51.530
I..

00:28:51.640 --> 00:28:53.970
I, Dio cannot... !

00:29:05.580 --> 00:29:09.040
There is only one cause of your defeat, Dio!

00:29:11.220 --> 00:29:14.280
One, simple answer.

00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:16.630
You made me...

00:29:17.400 --> 00:29:18.760
angry.

00:29:30.140 --> 00:29:31.130
And so...

00:29:31.240 --> 00:29:33.870
the next time I woke up...

00:29:34.510 --> 00:29:38.610
I was in the Speed Wagon
Foundation's paramedic helicopter.

00:29:39.320 --> 00:29:41.180
Through the battles of my comrades...

00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:44.690
and a blood transfusion
from Dio's remains...

00:29:44.790 --> 00:29:45.810
yes...

00:29:46.190 --> 00:29:48.520
I was able to come back to life.

00:29:48.660 --> 00:29:50.720
I owe it to my grandson
whom I'm proud of...

00:29:50.830 --> 00:29:53.800
and to the precious lives
that will never return.

00:29:54.770 --> 00:29:56.630
The terrifying evil...

00:29:56.740 --> 00:29:58.640
along with the shimmer
of the morning sun...

00:29:58.740 --> 00:30:00.860
is now disappearing into the Red Sea.

00:30:03.110 --> 00:30:06.940
As long as I live, I will not forget...

00:30:07.910 --> 00:30:09.240
about this journey...

00:30:09.350 --> 00:30:10.750
this sight...

00:30:15.420 --> 00:30:16.440
and...

00:30:17.690 --> 00:30:19.090
Kakyoin...

00:30:22.630 --> 00:30:23.820
Iggi...

00:30:27.700 --> 00:30:28.790
Avdol...

00:30:31.670 --> 00:30:33.040
It's over...!

00:30:47.220 --> 00:30:50.590
Do you still insist on going
back to France, Polnareff?

00:30:51.620 --> 00:30:53.720
You don't have any family there, do you?

00:30:53.860 --> 00:30:55.880
If you don't mind, why don't
you come to my place...

00:30:56.260 --> 00:30:58.160
in New York?

00:31:01.400 --> 00:31:02.420
Mr. Joestar...

00:31:02.530 --> 00:31:05.660
although I have no family left,
France is still my homeland.

00:31:07.510 --> 00:31:09.130
I have memories of my hometown.

00:31:09.270 --> 00:31:12.440
No matter where I go, it is
the place I always return to.

00:31:13.350 --> 00:31:14.900
Please call me if you need me.

00:31:15.050 --> 00:31:16.540
I'll come running...

00:31:17.580 --> 00:31:19.810
to anywhere in the world.

00:31:21.220 --> 00:31:22.950
I'm going to miss you.

00:31:27.630 --> 00:31:29.790
There were many painful times...

00:31:31.030 --> 00:31:32.890
but it was enjoyable.

00:31:34.470 --> 00:31:37.590
Because of you all, this
journey was enjoyable.

00:31:40.410 --> 00:31:41.500
Yes...

00:31:42.710 --> 00:31:44.110
I enjoyed it...

00:31:44.780 --> 00:31:47.540
from the bottom of my heart.

00:32:06.370 --> 00:32:07.700
See ya!

00:32:07.830 --> 00:32:09.320
You old man...

00:32:09.430 --> 00:32:10.990
try to live long!

00:32:11.940 --> 00:32:13.910
And as for your stingy grandson...

00:32:14.470 --> 00:32:16.770
don't you forget about me!

00:32:17.780 --> 00:32:18.940
We'll see you again!

00:32:19.310 --> 00:32:21.870
If you don't hate me, that is!

00:32:22.710 --> 00:32:23.680
You...

00:32:23.780 --> 00:32:24.710
silly-face!

00:32:26.520 --> 00:32:27.750
Even if I wanted to...

00:32:27.850 --> 00:32:30.950
you're the kind of character
who can't be forgotten easily.

00:32:33.760 --> 00:32:34.690
Take care!

00:32:54.780 --> 00:32:55.140
Mama!

00:32:55.280 --> 00:32:55.870
Mama!

00:32:56.010 --> 00:32:56.740
Wake up!

00:32:57.450 --> 00:32:58.210
Holley!

00:32:59.080 --> 00:33:00.140
Y-you...

00:33:01.220 --> 00:33:03.120
You regained consciousness!

00:33:03.260 --> 00:33:05.020
How are you feeling!?

00:33:05.160 --> 00:33:06.090
Somehow...

00:33:06.190 --> 00:33:07.350
all of a sudden...

00:33:07.460 --> 00:33:09.260
I feel great!

00:33:10.130 --> 00:33:10.920
In any case, Mama...

00:33:11.030 --> 00:33:11.860
let's get ready!

00:33:12.000 --> 00:33:12.520
Eh?

00:33:13.300 --> 00:33:14.930
They're coming home!

00:33:15.470 --> 00:33:16.990
Papa and Jotaro!

00:33:18.440 --> 00:33:19.400
I know it, Mama!

00:33:19.540 --> 00:33:20.600
Very soon!

00:33:21.110 --> 00:33:22.770
They're coming home!
